      "title": "Suditi Industries Limited announced that it expects to receive INR 266.492253 million in funding from Capwise Financial Services Private Limited, Alkaloids Private Limited, Swara Ventures LLP",
      "body": "Suditi Industries Limited announces a private placement with Capwise Financial Services Private Limited, Uniworth Creation Private Limited, Alkaloids Private Limited, Neo Markets Private Limited, Swara Ventures LLP, Mapkas Advisors LLP to issue 7,267,667 warrants at a price of INR 14.78 for gross proceeds of INR 107,416,118.26 and 2,690,733 Preferential Shares at a price of INR 59.12 for proceeds of INR 159,076,134.96 for aggregate proceeds of INR 266,492,253.22 on December 24, 2025. Warrant Exercise price is INR 44.34. The Board of Directors of the Company in its meeting held on December 19, 2025, subject to the approval of members, has approved the proposal for raising funds and allot by way of preferential issue of Warrants.",
